1
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:10,720
Over a decade ago,

2
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:12,840
the famous Huo Sanlang,

3
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,600
rumored to be the reincarnation of the Fire God.

4
00:01:18,039 --> 00:01:19,880
It was nothing but a cheap trick.

5
00:01:21,160 --> 00:01:22,490
Last night at midnight,

6
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,740
where were you?

7
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:25,480
I was in Wuyou City.

8
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:28,640
I have been staying in Wuyou City for over a decade,

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,039
until today,

10
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:32,780
when you captured me and brought me here.

11
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,840
We should find a chance to see

12
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,440
if this Huo Sanlang can be used

13
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:39,720
by my Bingjingwu.

14
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:41,320
My Lord,

15
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:44,960
he is just an old man who has been in Wuyou City for over a decade.

16
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:45,680
Shut up!

17
00:01:47,280 --> 00:01:49,400
With his marvelous fire escape technique,

18
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,130
ten of you can't compare to him.

19
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,300
My Lord,

20
00:01:54,479 --> 00:01:56,240
Uncle Chai is already enough trouble.

21
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:58,960
Are we going to add another prisoner from Wuyou City?

22
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,040
You are the one who attacked me

23
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:01,520
at the cave entrance that day, right?

24
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:03,920
I smell a strong scent of dogs on you.

25
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,800
You keep dogs, don't you?

26
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,080
Actually,

27
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,560
I've seen you and your dogs

28
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,300
a long time ago.

29
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:15,840
My name is Meng Qian,

30
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,680
making a living at Sangjia Wazi.

31
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,280
For those dogs, you used to

32
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,810
fight against the officials frequently.

33
00:02:24,079 --> 00:02:25,480
Your name is Qi Si, right?

34
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,800
You can understand human language, right?

35
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,000
If you understand me,

36
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,600
just nod.

37
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:40,840
Actually,

38
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,579
we are the same kind of people.

39
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:47,960
You have dogs to take care of.

40
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,520
I have a sister-in-law and a younger sister to take care of.

41
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,050
My sister is seriously ill.

42
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,560
The people who could call my name

43
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:55,240
are all gone.

44
00:02:57,160 --> 00:02:57,960
Then

45
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,440
I'll call you

46
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,440
Brother Qisi.

47
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,360
Just call me Chaijiu.

48
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:06,800
Okay,

49
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,240
Brother Chaijiu.

50
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:10,760
Brother Chaijiu.

51
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,300
Did you hear that just now?

52
00:03:12,640 --> 00:03:13,360
Someone...

53
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:15,200
Someone from above wants to let us go.

54
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:17,329
It's all because of that Official Chu.

55
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:18,400
Her?

56
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,440
Feigning compliance,

57
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:21,280
she won't be an official for much longer.

58
00:03:21,280 --> 00:03:22,740
Let's find a chance later.

59
00:03:23,640 --> 00:03:24,500
How about that?

60
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,240
Where can I go?

61
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,360
You...

62
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,170
don't you want freedom?

63
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:30,560
Just like before.

64
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:34,880
My Lord.

65
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:38,560
About releasing the prisoner,

66
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,360
Duke Zhou only gave us two hours.

67
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,040
Time is almost up.

68
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,340
Release the prisoner?

69
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:44,800
What prisoner?

70
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:47,360
Who in Bingjingwu needs to be released?

71
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,280
As for Liu Heizi,

72
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,400
continue the interrogation

73
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,530
until he confesses.

74
00:03:53,079 --> 00:03:54,280
What about Zhu Zitong?

75
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,940
I will give him a new identity.

76
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:56,880
My man

77
00:03:57,200 --> 00:03:58,160
does not need to be released.

78
00:03:58,160 --> 00:03:58,760
What?

79
00:03:59,880 --> 00:04:01,140
Don't you understand?

80
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:03,000
He is my man from Bingjingwu.

81
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:04,800
And the idler?

82
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:06,680
He is still useful.

83
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,680
Wait until Lord Zhou's men come back,

84
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,610
then we will see.

85
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,240
Sister,

86
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,160
I was just about to go looking for you.

87
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,690
How could I bear to make you tire yourself out?

88
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,600
The Lantern Festival is approaching.

89
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:29,400
Dongjing City is full of all sorts of people right now,

90
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,000
making it extremely unsafe.

91
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,720
I am truly worried about you.

92
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,200
Was that letter

93
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:37,840
helpful to you, Sister?

94
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:42,530
The word 'Liangshan' you deduced from the secret letter

95
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,760
must be true.

96
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:48,010
I have already encountered those thieves in Wuyou City.

97
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:49,360
Sister,

98
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:51,280
you actually went to Wuyou City?

99
00:04:52,520 --> 00:04:53,120
Yes.

100
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,760
Beneath Dongjing City,

101
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:56,920
there is indeed a whole other world.

102
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:57,880
And Wuyou City

103
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,760
is indeed very dangerous.

104
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,560
But how did those Liangshan thieves

105
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:07,680
find Wuyou City so easily?

106
00:05:08,560 --> 00:05:09,880
They found an idler.

107
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,520
That man is familiar with the geography of Dongjing.

108
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:13,480
He is called something like

109
00:05:13,480 --> 00:05:15,340
the Geography Ghost of Dongjing.

110
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,840
There is such a person?

111
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:22,740
There are indeed many capable and strange people in Dongjing.

112
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:23,970
Although you

113
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,200
are physically weak,

114
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,600
your wisdom and talent

115
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:30,560
are also exceptionally good, aren't they?

116
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,600
I don't even know

117
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,560
how to answer that, Sister.

118
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,000
However,

119
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:39,200
I would like to meet that idler.

120
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:42,240
He is still in my ice prison right now.

121
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:43,080
I always feel

122
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:46,409
that he hasn't confessed the whole truth yet.

123
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:49,120
What do you

124
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,280
want to do, Sister?

125
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,320
I ordered someone to bring his sister-in-law and sister here.

126
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,780
Let's see if he confesses.

127
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,200
His sister-in-law

128
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:56,960
and sister?

129
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,760
Although it's not a proper method,

130
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:04,020
Lord Zhou keeps urging me to release him.

131
00:06:04,240 --> 00:06:06,440
I'm afraid I can't delay it for too long.

132
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,440
Lord Zhou

133
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,200
wants you to release him?

134
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:14,000
He doesn't want me to continue investigating the assassins.

135
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:15,080
In that case.

136
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:19,520
Sister, why don't you have that idler's sister-in-law and sister

137
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,920
stay at the Zhao Mansion?

138
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:24,160
After all, they are not real criminals,

139
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:25,420
and they are two women.

140
00:06:25,800 --> 00:06:26,720
Staying in the Zhao Mansion

141
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:27,560
is also safe.

142
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,000
That's a good idea.

143
00:06:31,640 --> 00:06:33,280
You are so smart, Han.

144
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:41,000
Zhu Zitong.

145
00:06:41,840 --> 00:06:42,960
From today on.

146
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:48,080
I want you to assist Bingjingwu in investigating the case of the assassin and rebel.

147
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:49,409
These are your clothes.

148
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,680
I am just a commoner.

149
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:53,420
My abilities are limited.

150
00:06:54,040 --> 00:06:55,640
What kind of ability do I have

151
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,100
to help you solve the case?

152
00:06:57,159 --> 00:06:58,040
I am fully aware

153
00:06:58,520 --> 00:07:00,440
of your abilities.

154
00:07:01,320 --> 00:07:02,360
If you succeed,

155
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,600
I will naturally help you find

156
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,160
your long-lost daughter.

157
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:12,000
If you can help me find my daughter, sir,

158
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:13,440
I, Zhu Zitong,

159
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,580
will certainly do my best.

160
00:07:15,880 --> 00:07:16,400
My Lord.

161
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,520
Liu Heizi has confessed.

162
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,980
There is new information.

163
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,480
My Lord is handling a case.

164
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,540
Wait here quietly.

165
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,080
Do not leave.

166
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,680
Not so stubborn anymore?

167
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,720
Please spare my life, My Lord.

168
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,800
Then confess honestly.

169
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:41,850
What's in your arms?

170
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,280
The assassin,

171
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:44,760
the meeting time,

172
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,040
and the meeting place.

173
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,650
Who wrote this secret message?

174
00:08:06,480 --> 00:08:08,080
It's written in such detail.

175
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,600
This letter

176
00:08:10,560 --> 00:08:12,520
is poisoned.

177
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,120
What's wrong with you?

178
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:19,580
My Lord.

179
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:22,760
Capital Commander Chu has repeatedly disobeyed Lord Zhou's orders.

180
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:25,240
He really is in league with those thieves.

181
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,280
My Lord.

182
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:27,560
Our Capital Commander

183
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,480
would never collude with thieves.

184
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,880
Please do not jump to conclusions, My Lord.

185
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,000
There must be some misunderstanding here.

186
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,960
Please investigate thoroughly, My Lord.

187
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:39,620
How dare you

188
00:08:40,200 --> 00:08:41,400
question Lord Zhou.

189
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,039
Aren't you afraid

190
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:44,480
of losing your heads?

191
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:46,460
Calm down, my lord.

192
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:48,010
Perhaps there is

193
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,780
a misunderstanding here.

194
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,160
We will investigate immediately.

195
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,760
Then look into it right away.

196
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,680
I will watch right here,

197
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,680
so I can report back to Lord Zhou.

198
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,300
What does you being a rebel

199
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:02,690
have to do with our lord?

200
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:05,840
I contacted

201
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,600
Director Chu

202
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,440
in secret

203
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,720
to assassinate the Emperor.
